.TH AMIVULN-CACHE 1  "cache " 
.SH NAME
cache \- Inspect or clear the on\-disk cache
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcache\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect or clear the on\-disk cache
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
cache\-info(1)
Show where the cache lives and how big it is
.TP
cache\-clear(1)
Delete every cached response
.TP
cache\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
